GET http://localhost:8080/hello-world
###
GET http://localhost:8080/user/new

### Ping
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ping


### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks


### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nauczyć się REST API w Spring Boot"
}


### Create invalid task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}


### Mark task as done
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/done


### Mark non-existing task as done
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/999/done